<title>THAILAND: Thai 1997/98 soybean crop seen at 383,623 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Thai 1997/98 soybean crop seen at 383,623 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's 1997/98 soybean output was forecast at 383,623 tonnes from 352,279 tonnes estimated in 1996/97 (April-March), an agriculture ministry official said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
